# Accepted vulnerabilities. Each entry documents the blocker and why the
# vulnerable code is not shipped or not reachable from this project.

# torch: no fix available
# https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-4538
# torch is only in the optional `integration` dependency group (used by
# sentence-transformers in integration tests). It is not installed in the
# runtime image.
CVE-2026-4538 exp:2027-04-30

# torch: fixed in 2.13.0
# https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-3000
# torch is pinned to <2.11 because 2.11+ breaks the ORT license scan (see the
# HACK comment in pyproject.toml). Only in the optional `integration`
# dependency group; not installed in the runtime image.
CVE-2025-3000 exp:2027-04-30
